      <span class="num">~4.0 ms</span>
    </div>
    <div class="path-row micro">
      <span class="src">LD4↔FR2</span>
      <span class="desc">Slough, UK (LSE colo) ↔ Frankfurt (Deutsche Börse)</span>
      <span class="num">~660 km</span>
      <span class="num">~2.4 ms</span>
    </div>
    <div class="path-row micro">
      <span class="src">TYO↔SGX</span>
      <span class="desc">Tokyo ↔ Singapore (over partial water → mixed RF + fiber)</span>
